"""Run established four quality checks on the actually applied producer batch."""
import json
import subprocess
import sys
from pathlib import Path
BASE = Path('.runtime/porting/CTF-10')
snapshot = None
for role in ['fmt-check', 'clippy', 'focused', 'workspace']:
    prior = json.loads((BASE / ('report-output-' + role + '-command-02/receipt.json')).read_bytes())
    assert prior['exit_code'] == 0
    output = BASE / ('postlude-registry-severe-' + role + '-command-01')
    assert not output.exists()
    result = subprocess.run([sys.executable, '-X', 'utf8', '-B', 'tools/porting/record_command.py',
                             '--output-dir', str(output), '--', *prior['command']], stdout=subprocess.DEVNULL)
    actual = json.loads((output / 'receipt.json').read_bytes())
    print(json.dumps({'role': role, 'actual_exit_code': actual['exit_code'], 'source_snapshot': actual['source_snapshot']}), flush=True)
    assert result.returncode == 0 and actual['exit_code'] == 0 and actual['source_bytes_match_before_and_after'] is True
    if snapshot is None: snapshot = actual['source_snapshot']
    assert actual['source_snapshot'] == snapshot
